    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll be honest \u2014 Coffee Rush isn\u2019t as advanced as some of our other games. But it\u2019s got heart, and it was made to poke fun at something most of us have felt: the more coffee we drink, the faster we work\u2026 right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic office satire, you\u2019re just another overworked employee trying to impress the boss, survive the day, and maybe earn a slightly better office. Or at least not get fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacebar to jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift to drink coffee and sprint for a short time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here\u2019s the grind</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffee doesn\u2019t last forever \u2014 you\u2019ll need to find more. Cups appear randomly when coworkers leave them behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other employees may try to start conversations that slow you down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip on coffee puddles or get hit with books your coworkers think you need to read</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main job is to find the printer room, collect papers, and return them to your desk</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve delivered enough papers, you can either go see the boss and maybe get a new office \u2014 or keep trying to get more papers and earn a spot on the leaderboard. But you're always on the clock. Fall behind, and you're fired.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll be honest \u2014 Coffee Rush isn\u2019t as advanced as some of our other games. But it\u2019s got heart, and it was made to poke fun at something most of us have felt: the more coffee we drink, the faster we work\u2026 right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this chaotic office satire, you\u2019re just another overworked employee trying to impress the boss, survive the day, and maybe earn a slightly better office. Or at least not get fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spacebar to jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift to drink coffee and sprint for a short time</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here\u2019s the grind</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffee doesn\u2019t last forever \u2014 you\u2019ll need to find more. Cups appear randomly when coworkers leave them behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other employees may try to start conversations that slow you down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip on coffee puddles or get hit with books your coworkers think you need to read</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main job is to find the printer room, collect papers, and return them to your desk</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve delivered enough papers, you can either go see the boss and maybe get a new office \u2014 or keep trying to get more papers and earn a spot on the leaderboard. But you're always on the clock. Fall behind, and you're fired.</p>",
    "short_description": "Race through the office in this chaotic coffee-fueled satire. Find printer paper, dodge chatty coworkers, avoid spills, and grab abandoned coffee cups to boost your speed. Deliver enough to meet the boss or keep going to hit the leaderboard \u2014 but hurry, or you're fired!",
